  "lines-and-slope.dg.flipped": "You flipped the slope — now change its sign too. Perpendicular slopes multiply to −1.",
  "lines-and-slope.dg.signed": "You changed the sign — now flip the fraction too. Perpendicular slopes are negative <i>reciprocals</i>.",
  "lines-and-slope.dg.isPerp": "That one is perpendicular. Parallel lines have the <b>same</b> slope.",
